---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Customs Clearance"
  description="Import and export customs clearance across European and African markets with duty guidance."
  image="/images/customs.jpg"
>
  <Hero
    compact
    brand="CLEAR"
    headline="Hassle-free customs for complex consignments."
    support="Guidance on classifications, duties, taxes, and documentation at key ports."
    image="/images/customs.jpg"
    secondaryCta={{ label: 'Get a Quote', href: '/quote' }}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content reveal">
      <p>
        Nexar Solutions undertakes customs clearance for packages; new or used motor vehicles; household
        goods; personal effects; computers and electronics; food and non-food goods; palletised goods;
        containerised cargo; out-of-gauge, heavy haulage, and project cargo.
      </p>
      <p>
        We work with partners at entry ports of our African destinations so we can offer all-inclusive
        service including port and customs clearance. Skilled staff can discuss tariff classifications,
        potential duties and taxes, and tariff concessions.
      </p>
      <p>
        We handle import and export clearances in various African ports and Europe. As a registered
        Economic Operator with deep knowledge of EU and African customs procedures, we help cargo flow
        smoothly and keep clients informed throughout clearance.
      </p>

      <h2>Customs services include</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Customs formalities and procedures advice</li>
        <li>Customs tax exemptions</li>
        <li>Customs declaration and clearance</li>
        <li>Duty charges, claims, and refunds</li>
        <li>Clearance documentation</li>
        <li>Border customs clearance and facilitation</li>
      </ul>

      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Discuss customs formalities</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .content {
    max-width: 72ch;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .btn {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
